WEBVTT

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:32.000
just only at the age of 11 years.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.760
Along with Lydian is award winning singer 
Shalmali Kholgade,

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:39.430
who herself has been singing since 
her very young age,

00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:41.822
at concerts, on stage and 
for big films.

00:00:41.822 --> 00:00:44.992
Here we present tomorrow's song 
in the voice of New India.

00:00:44.992 --> 00:00:49.272
Please welcome on stage 
Lydian Nadhswaram and Shalmali Kholgade

00:00:49.277 --> 00:00:54.717
(Applause)

00:00:54.717 --> 00:01:01.467
(Piano music)